</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/149ac3a8-a137-11f1-b104-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26238334534782.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/149ac3a8-a137-11f1-b104-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26238334534782.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">30fe52f8-a2ef-11f1-82b9-45cf01014b61</guid><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 14:47:48 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>艾米</dc:creator></item><item><category>美国动向</category><title>特朗普收紧签证政策　中国人的“美国梦”还在吗？</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%8A%A8%E5%90%91/20260828-%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E6%94%B6%E7%B4%A7%E7%AD%BE%E8%AF%81%E6%94%BF%E7%AD%96-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84-%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%A2%A6-%E8%BF%98%E5%9C%A8%E5%90%97</link><description>
